{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"船里失去平衡\",\"source\":\"但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈，船舱内的平衡就越脆弱。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿写的是平衡变得更加脆弱，并未说已经失去平衡；屏幕稿把潜在的不稳写成了已经发生的失衡。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"年少时初恋的下午\",\"source\":\"年少时第一次心动的下午\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"第一次心动不等于已经经历初恋，屏幕稿把较开放的心动时刻具体化成了初恋经历。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7a6d9a1f-144d-4d18-bde2-1e8652af9835", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T060621076405Z", "elapsed_seconds": 176.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:09:17.680913+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "250d425900b394a6556677a603827ca55b4acd3b9b76b185078033a36d233f40", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}